-60.117333-60.074667l-0.256-11.008h142.506667v11.008a60.16 60.16 0 0 1-60.117334 60.074667z m152.917334-275.2A272.64 272.64 0 0 0 591.957333 725.333333h-44.330666v-255.445333a106.666667 106.666667 0 0 0 71.125333-100.096 35.584 35.584 0 1 0-71.125333 0 35.584 35.584 0 0 1-71.082667 0 35.584 35.584 0 1 0-71.125333 0 106.666667 106.666667 0 0 0 71.125333 100.096V725.333333h-47.018667a307.029333 307.029333 0 0 0-87.04-137.984 248.874667 248.874667 0 0 1 169.941334-430.933333 246.101333 246.101333 0 0 1 165.376 63.232 248.661333 248.661333 0 0 1-1.706667 372.693333h-0.085333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-064cc47f="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Suggest domain names and connect Netlify to Namecheap DNS</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-064cc47f="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-064cc47f="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" aria-hidden="true" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-b90066f2="" data-v-9019dc97="" class="toolcall-content"><div class="scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-top" aria-hidden="true"></div><div data-v-b90066f2="" class="resize-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-b90066f2="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-048cb31c="" data-v-9019dc97="" class="markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-048cb31c="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">User has a Netlify site (ads site) and needs a domain. They already bought from Namecheap. Answer: recommend domain suggestions for an ads site, and how to connect Netlify to Namecheap DNS. Keep concise, ask about site type/name maybe. Provide steps.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">No need for search really — this is practical guidance. Could suggest TLDs: .com if available, or .online/.site/.shop etc. Also explain DNS setup: either point Nameservers to Netlify DNS, or A record + CNAME, or use Netlify's custom domain with Namecheap DNS (A record to 75.2.60.5 and CNAME www to site.netlify.app).</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Give recommendations and steps briefly in Arabic.</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="scroll-edge-fade scroll-edge-fade-bottom" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="scroll-edge-fade-measure-sentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----></div><div data-v-0a722276="" class="toolcall-rollup__part toolcall-rollup__flat"><!----> <div data-v-048cb31c="" data-v-8fac2c49="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-048cb31c="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">ممتاز، إنك عندك حساب Namecheap يسهّل عليك الأمور لأن ربطهم مع Netlify سهل. خليني أساعدك بشقين:</div><h2 class="">1. اقتراحات للدومين (حسب نوع الإعلانات)</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">لموقع إعلانات، الأهم أن يكون سهل الحفظ ويحتوي كلمة تعبّر عن محتواك:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>.com</strong> — الأولوية دائماً إذا كان متاح (سعر ~11$ أول سنة على Namecheap)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>إذا مأخوذ:</strong> جرّب <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code-inline">get[اسمك].com</code> أو <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code-inline">اسمك + ads/bazar/souq/market</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>امتدادات أرخص وأنسب للإعلانات:</strong></div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code-inline">.online</code> / <code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code-inline">.site</code> — حوالي 2-3$ أول سنة</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code-inline">.shop</code> — مناسب إذا الإعلانات تجارية</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code-inline">.net</code> — احتياطي إذا .com مأخوذ</div></li></ul></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">نصيحة: ابحث عن دومين على Namecheap وشوف "Premium DNS" تجنّبه لأنه إضافة مدفوعة غير ضرورية.</div><h2 class="">2. ربط الدومين بـ Netlify (خطوات بسيطة)</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong class="">الطريقة الأسهل — DNS من Netlify:</strong></div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">في Netlify: <strong>Domain settings → Add a domain</strong> واكتب الدومين الجديد</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">في Namecheap: <strong>Domain List → Manage → Nameservers</strong> وغيّرها إلى DNS المخصص:</div><div data-v-bfaabce6="" data-v-048cb31c="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-bfaabce6="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-bfaabce6="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-bfaabce6="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-bfaabce6="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-bfaabce6=""><div data-v-ab0641ea="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-ab0641ea="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.